#before peer create 保留用的对话 {T} post:这件事也做完了 {T}
#before wait-chat 保留用的对话 {T}
# 保留 under the agent's last all-done post (Chat.kt ArchiveUnder): the chat kept (chat.keep, 已保留… said); the two
# buttons go (280 ms, ArchiveEase) and the bar's 归档 with them, the chat no longer offered to archive.
timeout 90000
until 保留用的对话 {T}
until 这件事也做完了 {T}
tap 保留用的对话 {T}
until 归档此对话
until icon:archive
wait 1500
shot 1-offered
tap =保留
until 已保留
gone =归档此对话
gone icon:archive
shot 2-kept
